# Naming Conventions (Shared Atom)

> Applies to: Product-Designer, Frontend-Developer, Backend-Developer, QA-Tester, PM/Lead

---

## 1. Branch Format

```
<type>/<ticket-id>_<description>
```

| Type | Example | Ticket ID | Description |
|------|---------|-----------|-------------|
| `feature` | `feature/1_push-code` | `1` | `push-code` |
| `bugfix` | `bugfix/2_fix-login` | `2` | `fix-login` |
| `hotfix` | `hotfix/3_security-patch` | `3` | `security-patch` |
| `release` | `release/1.1.0` | N/A | Version number |

---

## 2. File Naming

```
<description>-<ticket-id>_<type>_<yymmdd>_v<major>.<month>.<day>.md
```

| Component | Source | Example |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| `<description>` | Branch (kebab-case) | `push-code` |
| `<ticket-id>` | Branch | `1` |
| `<type>` | Doc type | `master`, `product`, `engineering`, `qa`, `tasks` |
| `<yymmdd>` | Date | `260407` |
| Version | `v<major>.<month>.<day>` | `v1.4.7` |

### Type → Folder Mapping

| Type | Folder | Role |
|------|--------|------|
| `master` | `Docs/00-master/` | PM/Lead |
| `product` | `Docs/01-product/` | Product-Designer |
| `engineering` | `Docs/02-engineering/` | Frontend + Backend |
| `qa` | `Docs/03-qa/` | QA-Tester |
| `tasks` | `Docs/04-tasks/` | PM/Lead |

### Versioning

| Event | Action | Example |
|-------|--------|---------|
| Content change | Increment day | `v1.4.6` → `v1.4.7` |
| New month | Reset day, increment month | `v1.4.9` → `v1.5.0` |
| Major release | Reset month+day, increment major | `v1.12.9` → `v2.0.0` |

---

## 3. Folder Structure

```
Docs/
├── 00-master/              # Master documents
├── 01-product/             # Product Doc + wireframes + mockups
│   ├── design-system/      # .pencil component library
│   ├── wireframes/         # Stage 1 wireframes
│   └── mockups/            # Stage 2 visual mockups
├── 02-engineering/         # Engineering Doc (FE + BE sections)
├── 03-qa/                  # QA Doc + test results
├── 04-tasks/               # Task breakdown
└── 05-changelog/           # Optional changelog
```

---

## 4. Rules

- ✅ **kebab-case** only — no spaces, no special chars
- ✅ Always include version + date
- ✅ File in correct `Docs/` subfolder
- ✅ Extension: `.md` (docs), `.pencil` (design files)
